flowchart TD
    Start([Start Inpatient Discharge]) --> SignSummary[Doctor Prepares & Signs Discharge Summary]
    SignSummary --> InitiateWorkflow[Initiate Discharge Workflow in System]
    InitiateWorkflow --> VerifyBill{Final Bill Status == Paid?}
    VerifyBill -- No --> DirectToCashier[Direct Patient to Cashier Desk for Settlement] --> SettleBill[Cashier Settles Final Bill] --> VerifyBill
    VerifyBill -- Yes --> FinalizeDischarge[Receptionist Approves Discharge]
    FinalizeDischarge --> UpdateAdmissionStatus[Update Admission Status = Discharged]
    UpdateAdmissionStatus --> ReleaseBed[Release Allocated Bed -> Status = Available]
    ReleaseBed --> PrintGatePass[Print Discharge Summary Folder & Gate Pass]
    PrintGatePass --> End([End Discharge])
